What does this log?
```js
import { readFile } from 'node:fs';
const log = console.log;
readFile(new URL(import.meta.url), () => {
  setTimeout(() => log('timeout'), 0);
  setImmediate(() => log('immediate'));
});
```

What does this log?
```js
import { readFile } from 'node:fs';
const log = console.log;
readFile(new URL(import.meta.url), () => {
  setTimeout(() => log('t'));
  setImmediate(() => log('i'));
  Promise.resolve().then(() => log('p'));
  process.nextTick(() => log('n'));
});
```

